## Findings
- **Dataset 1 (food-detection-union-rhdem):**
  - Images: 51,343
  - Task: Object Detection
  - Classes: Extensive list including Apple, Banana, Broccoli, Carrot, Lemon, Orange, Pineapple, etc. (Mostly fruits/vegetables).
  - Quality: High image count, likely a union of several specific datasets.
- **Dataset 3 (food-detection-xt7yz):**
  - Images: 6,435
  - Task: Object Detection
  - Classes: `['food']` (Single class).
  - Status: Simple detection, good for "finding" food but not classifying type.
